ACCESSIBILITY STANDARDS DISCLAIMER

While this software aims to improve web accessibility, it does NOT guarantee:
- Full compliance with WCAG (Web Content Accessibility Guidelines)
- Compliance with ADA (Americans with Disabilities Act)
- Compliance with Section 508 or any other accessibility regulations
- That websites will become fully accessible to all users
- That all accessibility issues will be detected or fixed

Users are solely responsible for ensuring their websites meet applicable
accessibility standards and legal requirements. This software is a tool to
assist with accessibility improvements but does not replace professional
accessibility audits, testing with real users, or legal compliance reviews.

